um_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Cost categories and who pays**\n\n| Category | Examples | Payer |\n|---|---|---|\n| **One-time** | Platform onboarding; prospectus and 485 filing work; exchange listing; ticker/CUSIP; index setup; launch marketing | Sponsor |\n| **Recurring fixed** | Platform/trust minimums; administration, custody and transfer-agent minimums; audit/tax; board/CCO allocation; annual listing; data; marketing | Sponsor, paid from the unitary fee |\n| **Recurring asset-based** | Platform, servicing or index-license fees charged in basis points | Sponsor, paid from the unitary fee |\n| **Fund-borne exclusions** | Brokerage, taxes, interest, acquired-fund fees, extraordinary or litigation costs | Shareholders, per the advisory agreement |\n\n**Seed assets** are invested capital, not expenditure. The sponsor recovers them at market value when redeemed. Budget only their carrying costs: market or hedging risk, financing or opportunity cost, and any capital charges.\n\n**Break-even at a positive retained margin**\n\n- F = annual fixed costs plus amortized one-time costs (USD)\n- f = unitary fee rate\n- v = variable cost rate\n- m = target retained margin as a share of revenue\n\nRequired AUM = F ÷ (f(1−m) − v), valid only if f(1−m) > v. Use actual contracted quotes for each input.","ttft_ms":6788,"type":"result","duration_ms":10913,"uuid":"70594db9-529d-4d9b-bb83-77cf716f4b58","ttft_stream_ms":1512,"time_to_request_ms":73,"first_content_frame_ms":1512,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
